  "__note": "Deliberately changed in Phase 53 Plan 01 (ROI-01). This fixture's evidence_class was QUASI_EXPERIMENTAL_IMPACT, chosen only because it is the longest of the nine literals and this golden exists to drive the metadata payload OVER the byte ceiling. Phase 53's class gate refuses a value for the three causal-impact labels, so that choice stripped the value family, dropped the record below the ceiling, and silently stopped exercising the truncation path this golden is for. Moved to CUSTOMER_CONFIGURED -- the longest of the five classes that may carry a value (19 chars vs 24). This is NOT one of the four immutable v1.x wire-contract goldens (jobs-outcome, meter-completion, meter-completion-markerless, meter-tool-event); it is a truncation variant, and the truncation behaviour it pins is unchanged. || Deliberately changed in quick-261017-nck (2026-10-17). `--metadata` moved to the schema_version 2 shape: nested value/basis/costs/estimator groups instead of one flat key list (see CHANGELOG [Unreleased]). The pattern was re-derived from the reporter's actual emitted argv for this record, not hand-written. v2 also dropped bounds_source (16 emoji, 192 bytes), cost_coverage.included and some key length, which took this record's shipped pre-shed blob to about 3.7 KB, under the 4096-byte ceiling, and the golden would have silently stopped exercising truncation. The fixture record in tests/test_compat_jobs_outcome.py (_build_over_ceiling_sidecar_record) therefore gained value-tier ballast that production can emit: the attribution pair with attribution_basis at the 500 characters the forwarder allows, under the coherent incremental_revenue mechanism (shorter than augmentation_capacity_expansion by 12 bytes). Measured against the real forwarder: pre-shed 4250 bytes, post-tier-1 3264 bytes. The ceiling is unchanged. Tier 1 now sheds the `value` and `costs` groups and basis.role/hours_saved/hourly_rate; tier 2 is still not reached, so basis.evidence/mechanism/confidence, session, status and the whole estimator group survive and `metadata_truncated` is the last key. This golden still proves value sheds before provenance. Still NOT one of the four immutable v1.x goldens."
